The official Q-version artwork that `npm run fetch-art` downloads into art/ is
NOT part of this repository and is NOT covered by this licence. It is
publisher-commissioned art owned by third parties:

  - Closure (可露希尔) — © Hypergryph / Studio Montagne, from "Arknights"
  - Sengoku Yuno (千石由乃) — © Bushiroad, from "BanG Dream!" / Mugendai MewType

The fetch script exists precisely so that those files are obtained by each user
rather than redistributed here. The placeholder glyph in lib/client.js is an
original generic "image missing" symbol and is covered by the MIT grant above.

This project is an unofficial fan work and is not affiliated with or endorsed by
either rights holder.
